Table full name: bigquery-public-data.geo_census_blockgroups.blockgroups_23
Column name: geo_id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier for each block group. Census block group identifier; a concatenation of the current state FIPS code, county FIPS code, census tract code, and block group number.
Column name: state_fips_code Type: STRING Description: Two digit FIPS code that uniquely identifies each state. See https://www.census.gov/geo/reference/ansi_statetables.html for more information State names and their corresponding FIPS codes are available as a BigQuery Public Dataset: `bigquery-public-data.census_utility.fips_codes_states`
Column name: county_fips_code Type: STRING Description: Four-digit county FIPS code. County names and their corresponding FIPS codes can be found in BigQuery: `bigquery-public-data.census_utility.fips_codes_all`
Column name: tract_ce Type: STRING Description: Current Census tract code
Column name: blockgroup_ce Type: STRING Description: Current block group number
Column name: lsad_name Type: STRING Description: Current translated legal/statistical area description and the block group number
Column name: mtfcc_feature_class_code Type: STRING Description: MAF/TIGER feature class code (G5030)
Column name: functional_status Type: STRING Description: Current functional status
Column name: area_land_meters Type: INT64 Description: Current land area
Column name: area_water_meters Type: INT64 Description: Current water area
Column name: internal_point_lat Type: FLOAT64 Description: Latitude of the block group's internal point, which is the point at or closest to the block group's geographic center
Column name: internal_point_lon Type: FLOAT64 Description: Longitude of the block group's internal point, which is the point at or closest to the block group's geographic center
Column name: internal_point_geom Type: GEOGRAPHY Description: Geographical representation of the block group's internal point, which is the point at or closest to the block group's geographic center
Column name: blockgroup_geom Type: GEOGRAPHY Description: Geographical representation of the polygon that defines the perimeter of the block group. This column should be used as the GEO column for visualization in BigQuery Geo Viz
